comments[3]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-07-25T09:19:45.181Z",unknown,"Duplicate-check evidence: exact all-status searches for GH-700/701/702 and run 30147320142 found no current owner. Closed pm-lvd647 repaired the previous Node 22/Windows failure class and is canonical lineage,but its stable-runtime SQLite exclusion now conflicts with newer Node 22 derived-index tests; this is a distinct regression bundle."
  "2026-07-25T11:31:36.222Z","harness:codex","Evidence: Node 22 sqlite derived-index paths and portable filesystem/cache seams passed 32/32 linked tests; Node 22 local scale run resolved the Node 26 RSS variance. GitHub nightly matrix remains the authoritative clean-runner proof for GH-700/701/702."
  "2026-07-25T11:57:41.946Z","harness:codex","Exact-head delivery evidence: PR #707 head 7c1921db passed every required GitHub check, including static quality, Windows Node 24, Ubuntu Node 22/24 and macOS smokes, typecheck, compatibility, all four coverage shards plus the 100% coverage gate, CodeQL, Semgrep, Trivy, TruffleHog, ShellCheck, PSScriptAnalyzer, docs/skills, package smokes, and benchmarks. Manual packed Node/Bun consumer acceptance and telemetry/Sentry gates also passed. Automated review returned no inline findings; CodeRabbit/Sourcery/Gemini/Greptile limitations are documented on the PR and Greptile quota is linked to canonical pm-e02lgu."
